SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] cycling — 92km @ 128–160W (Z2\, lower half only)\
 , no tempo blocks — tre
DESCRIPTION:92km @ 128–160W (Z2\, lower half only)\, no tempo blocks — 
 treat as a pure aerobic long ride\; do not add Z3 blocks this week regardl
 ess of how good you feel\, as Wk8 is the first full-load week after a reco
 very deficit.\n\nReason: Adding Z3 tempo in the first properly-loaded week
  after a severe recovery crash risks another fatigue spike\; keep Week 8's
  long ride aerobic to ensure the subsequent run and swim sessions can also
  be completed.\n\nAI coaching 2026-08-01
END:VEVENT
